WEBVTT

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:03.370
Christmas Eve

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:06.420
Senpai... what's your wish?
Christmas Eve

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.460
Mine?
Christmas Eve

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:11.380
I'm God; I have no need for such a thing.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:14.130
Anyhow, shut it and drag the cart!

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:16.430
Let me go, please.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.850
That is <i>my</i> wish.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.890
Santa should be riding on a sleigh.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:23.600
Pigs and reindeer are the ones who should be pulling it!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:28.360
That harshness of your words feels awesome!

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.020
Don't you start enjoying it now!

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:31.190
You're so strict!

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:32.360
Hurry up and drop it there already!

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.190
Right away!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.490
We've got plenty more to go.

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.660
And we're going to set all these up today.

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:39.620
Eh?!

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:40.870
Mio-san!

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.410
I brought the slips.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:47.750
It's not even Tanabata... What are you going to do with these?

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.880
People will hang them on the "Wish upon a Christmas Tree".

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:50.170
"Wish Upon A Christmas Tree" - Those who write their wishes and hang them upon this tree will have them granted by Santa Claus.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:55.340
We're going to award those who wish for salvation with a present.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:58.090
Why would you do something like that?

00:00:58.090 --> 00:00:59.260
Did you say something?

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:00.810
N-No, nothing...

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:05.890
Making wishes come true is also one of God's duties!

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:09.610
Help!!

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:18.950
Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu... YES!! Help U

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:25.160
Hey you lost boy, with a face full of despair

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:27.420
If you throw out the straw you're leaning on,

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.460
I guess that can't be helped either?

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.710
Fate is (straying away)

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.920
Being mean again today (going beserk)

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:40.760
At least I want to be on your side, but what can I do?

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.850
NO!! Jesus crisis! Oh My God!

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:45.890
Try leaving it to me

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:48.060
YES!! Chu-ru-Chu-Chu-Chu Help U

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.350
Just getting there is too weak,

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.900
get destroyed to nothing and then?

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:57.570
DNA is stubborn. Overdoing isn't allowed.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:01:59.950
With 5 seconds remaining I ended it forcefully (right before)

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.160
Feeling like getting reborn? (no way)

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:07.000
If we do the hands-on-approach rehab; you'll go to HEAVEN

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.330
Without even letting you say yes

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:11.580
With these hands

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:15.460
I'll fix you up right away

00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:20.050
A little fall in love feeling bigger than your presence is

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:25.010
making me unable to leave you alone with that miserable face.

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:29.190
I made it a meeting to change your outlook on life.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:34.270
So just start going along with the flow

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:37.360
I'm off to HELP YOU!

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.030
A Christmas Wish

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.090
Christmas Day

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:47.760
And so, we've gathered up all these wishes...
Christmas Day

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:50.300
It's a lot less than I thought there'd be.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:53.300
We're doing it for free, too.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:58.180
Well, even thought they write stuff like
"I want to be beautiful" or "I want to become filthy rich",

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:00.560
there's not much we can do.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:04.270
We can't even grant these wishes since there are no names in the first place.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:05.820
Can I leave?

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:09.690
Jeez, I called you over 'cause I
thought I'd need some help and yet...

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:13.950
Mio-san, these are the only ones
with a writer's name on them.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:14.910
<b>Please help out at my father's café
- Café Alice
Hiring waitresses! We need help, and fast!
-Cake House Amviller's House Anb</b>

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.950
One asking us to help out at a café...

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:18.730
and the second one is a cake house.

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:20.830
All right! Then it's settled!

00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:22.540
Which one would you like to do, then?

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:24.250
Both, of course!

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:28.500
Since we have this many people,
we'll just split up and grant them both!

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:34.430
<i><b>Café Alice</b></i>

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.550
So it's this place.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.060
Oh, this is it, right?

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.860
No way. Both of them are...

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:48.270
They're right across the street from each other?

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:52.150
So basically... this makes us rivals, huh?

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.450
Rivals?

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:56.200
We're going to fight this one out!

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:57.700
Hey, wait a second.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.950
Interesting. We'll take you on!

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:03.210
There's no way I can back down when I hear "competition".

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:08.090
In that case, wouldn't it be more exciting if I added a prize?

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:09.500
Prize

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.370
Me?

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:13.470
You can do whatever you want with him if you manage to win.

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:15.970
I'll do my best!

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:19.470
Hasn't our goal changed a bit?

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:22.810
Come on then, we're gonna get this thing started!

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.350
Welcome!

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:28.520
M-M-Mio-sama!

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:31.940
You're the one from the Sakuramori Festival...

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:37.320
I came to grant your wish to save this store!

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.990
That slip is...

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:44.000
B-But getting your help... I just couldn't...

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.830
Oh, you two are here as well?

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:49.630
Yeah... let's try to get along.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.880
Putting that aside, this place sure does suck.

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.090
I'm sorry, it's quite old.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:57.760
This makes the challenge all the more interesting.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:01.140
We definitely won't let the store across the street beat us!

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.650
This is kinda embarrassing...

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.950
What's up with these outfits?

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.000
It's reconnaissance.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.710
We can't let them find out who we are.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:29.410
Eh?

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:32.340
Starting now, the two of us are a couple.

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.380
This should be natural enough since it's Christmas, right?

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:38.300
S-Senpai...

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:41.970
Why are you getting all red, Pig-boy?

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:44.640
This is just role play, got it? Jeez.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.940
Welcome!

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:52.900
Hmm... There's quite a few customers in here.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.940
Reasonable prices and a wide selection...

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.360
They don't skimp on the presentation either.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:00.030
You're right.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.450
The problem must be the taste!

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.210
It's so good!

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.710
This one's quite good, too!

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:11.710
Really?

00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:16.210
What? You don't want to?

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:18.470
No, it's not that...

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:20.130
Then hurry up!

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:21.430
All right...

00:06:26.220 --> 00:06:28.350
So great!

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.270
I guess we shouldn't underestimate this store.

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:33.860
Are you two a couple?

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:38.650
We're currently holding a limited
Christmas event for couples!

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:39.570
An event?

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:43.530
The two of you will eat this together,
and once you're at your limit, you stop.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:47.290
There will be a prize awaiting you
depending on the size of the leftover!

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:49.660
There's no way we can do that!

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:51.710
Is this possibly your first date?

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:53.830
That could make it a bit difficult, I suppose...

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:54.700
That's not the problem!

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:58.920
You're basically saying that if we don't do it,
you won't recognize us as a couple?

00:06:58.920 --> 00:06:59.970
So you're challenging me, huh?

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:01.010
Um, hello?

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.680
Then bring it on!

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:07.140
Well then, start!

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:13.100
Y-You start eating first.

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.020
Welcome!

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.730
Would you like a Christmas cake?

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:57.230
They're really delicious!

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:59.230
Nozomi, which one do you want?

00:07:59.610 --> 00:08:01.780
All of them look really tasty, don't they?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.360
Excuse me...

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:05.280
All right, I got it.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:06.490
I'll take this cake, please.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:07.740
Oh, and some spare ribs.

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:09.400
R-Right away...

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.540
Th-Thank you very much...

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.860
The Hentai Force is strong with this one...

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.840
Well... are you two about to give up?

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.180
What are you doing, Tarou?!

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:33.850
Sado-kun! Mio-san!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.020
I didn't recognize them at all!

00:08:36.020 --> 00:08:37.430
We actually got caught...

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.270
We're leaving, Pig-boy.

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:40.360
Ah, okay...

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.690
Thank you very much for your visit!

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:47.530
It's so unfair that Mio-san's the only one who gets to be with Tarou all the time.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:51.740
Bluntly put, the store over there is a powerful enemy.

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.410
Oh, no...

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:56.000
Come up with a good idea right here, right now!

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.540
Don't be ridiculous!

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:58.960
My, my, everyone.

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:02.960
Please, have a glass of our specialty: royal milk tea.

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:04.380
This is my father.

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.470
What's with him? He sure is easygoing.

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:09.260
So... what are we going to do?

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:13.100
I guess.. we have no choice but to come up with a new menu!

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:15.060
No matter what you say...

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:17.480
It's fine. Just leave it all to me!

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.610
Mio-sama's handmade food...

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:23.320
Even if the store goes under this instant, I have no more regrets!

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.610
Spaghetti with squid ink?

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:29.240
It's carbonara!

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.620
Come on! Have a bite, Pig-boy!

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:31.780
M-Me?!

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:32.910
You don't want to?

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:34.040
Please, of course I do...

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:34.790
Say...

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:35.910
"Aaaahh!"

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:37.250
Tarou!

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:39.670
Dayum!

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.500
Oh, the bitterness in my mouth...

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.380
Bitter

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:45.510
Oh, the spicy pain on top of my tongue!

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:47.260
Pain

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:47.370
Oh, the spicy pain on top of my tongue!

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:52.100
This must be the black hole of pasta!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:57.940
Mio-shama's special carbonara...

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:58.230
More...

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:00.940
I never expected it to move someone this much.

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:04.270
Of course it did! Mio-sama made it herself, after all.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.320
Now then, Father, let's have some together.

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:09.810
Class Rep!

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:12.870
Was it so good you fainted?

00:10:13.530 --> 00:10:15.410
Welcome!

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.830
Would you like some of our store's famous cake?

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.710
And now, coffee at half price!

00:10:20.920 --> 00:10:23.670
This is a limited offer!

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.300
A time-limited sale, huh? They sure thought it through.

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:30.800
Senpai, what do we do?

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:32.920
We're going to go above and beyond here!

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:36.810
These are...

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:39.270
I found them earlier.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:41.350
Were these on the menu?

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:42.980
We can absolutely win with these.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:48.280
Everything here at only 2 yen!
A limited clearance sale!

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:50.780
2 yen? Isn't this kind of bad, after all?

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:51.820
Who cares?

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:53.570
What belongs to the stores, belongs to the customer!

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:55.230
Let's just sell them all!

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:58.620
Selling at 2 yen is cheating!

00:10:58.620 --> 00:10:59.740
If it comes down to this...

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.670
Attention, everyone!

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:05.620
If you purchase now, you'll get an extra good luck charm from a beauty!

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:07.550
A good luck charm?

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:09.460
Now, now. Everyone's waiting.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:11.090
Uh, what am I supposed to do?

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:14.180
Become delicious! Become delicious!

00:11:14.430 --> 00:11:15.960
Hey, you do it too.

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:21.020
Uh... Become delicious.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:22.800
Become delicous!

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:24.190
Lovely!

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:25.610
Spicy!

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:26.820
Shot...

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:29.280
to your heart!

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:31.610
Bam bam!

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:35.480
We'll play our trump card too, then!

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:40.540
Here I wondrously descend upon this commoner's store!

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:43.120
Why do I have to do it too? And in this outfit...

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:47.130
All right, you two. Go and attract all men with your charms!

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:50.880
I'll make all of them bow down to my beauty.

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:54.800
They'll definitely realize I'm a guy!

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:58.600
You really don't recognize your cross-dressing skills, do you?

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:01.850
There shouldn't be too many of them that would actually notice it,

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:03.100
Taroko-chan!

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:05.010
Taroko-chan...?

00:12:05.010 --> 00:12:06.980
Welcome! Welcome!

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:09.110
Plenty of cute girls waiting for you right here!

00:12:09.110 --> 00:12:12.690
Come, commoners, bow down and praise me!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:14.320
Hurry up and get out!

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.070
It's too embarrassing!

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.080
I'm telling you to get out already!

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:26.750
Um...

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:28.880
Welcome!

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.510
We'll lose at this rate!

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:36.510
Then there's no other choice left.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:38.510
Flash!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:41.140
The charm of an adult!

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.350
An adult's charm!

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:45.940
That was a great move!

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:48.310
It's special service time!

00:12:49.480 --> 00:12:52.780
The mature Noa will also provide some flashing action!

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:56.320
Noa-sama, how exhilarating!

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.910
I don't remember calling for you!

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:00.200
Damn you...

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:01.370
In that case we'll...

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.370
Come on, put this on and move it!

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:05.620
That's just too much!

00:13:05.620 --> 00:13:07.580
You have no right to refuse!

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.540
An older woman's charm is irresistible!

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.250
The loli legs are too difficult to give up too!

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.840
I like this girl the most!

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:19.050
Men are scary! Scary! Scary! Scary! Scary!

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:22.510
Merry Christmas!

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:34.530
Wow... It's finally over.

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:37.200
Who won in the end, I wonder.

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:40.370
Well, getting the problem solved is the only thing that matters, right?

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:43.240
Noa had lots of fun here with everyone!

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:45.700
By the way, where's Tatsukichi-kun?

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.710
Uh... Where could he have gone to?

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:52.460
The store's closed for today.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:57.420
Excuse me... I had a reservation here for 4 o'clock.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:58.970
Huh? A reservation?

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:01.600
Yes, for a birthday party.

00:14:01.600 --> 00:14:03.140
Don't you mean a Christmas party?

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:08.190
The birthday of a girl in my class is also on Christmas, so...

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:12.110
I wanted to properly celebrate her birthday.

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:14.230
Birthday...

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.650
The cake from earlier...

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:20.030
What do we do?

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:22.320
We won't make it on time even if we start baking one now.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:24.990
There's nothing we can do.

00:14:24.990 --> 00:14:26.790
We better apologize and turn them down.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:29.790
We can't...

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:32.960
We're going to hold this birthday party.

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:33.790
But...

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:37.050
We're doing it, no matter what.

00:14:38.090 --> 00:14:40.050
But still, how?

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:43.930
Please...

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:51.400
All right then.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:52.600
Let's hold that party.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:54.650
Hold on, commoner!

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:57.230
Tatsu... mi-san, I'll leave the cooking to you.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:14:59.400
Yuuno and I will set up the shop.

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:03.780
Mamiya-san and Hiiragi-san will go buy the cake.

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:04.910
Sheesh.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:06.700
Guess we'll have to, huh?

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:30.260
Happy birthday to you.

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:33.150
Happy birthday, dear...

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:35.770
Mio...

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:43.190
Happy birthday to you.

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:48.030
Happy birthday!

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:54.500
Oh, I'm beat!

00:15:54.500 --> 00:15:57.380
But I'm so glad they enjoyed it.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:59.500
That little girl looked really happy.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:02.050
Nothing's impossible for a god!

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:09.890
<i>Happy birthday, dear... Mio.</i>

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:13.520
Michiru-sensei...

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.400
What's wrong? You look quite puzzled there.

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:22.240
Is today... Isurugi-senpai's birthday as well?

00:16:24.110 --> 00:16:24.860
It is...

00:16:25.450 --> 00:16:28.870
However, Mio doesn't like her own birthday.

00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:32.620
She's always been alone on her birthday ever since she was little.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:35.330
But this year's different.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:37.790
Wishes, huh?

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:42.840
It might have been just an excuse to be with everyone...

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.340
<i>You MM bastard!</i>

00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:52.430
<i>Don't you ever forget again, idiot.</i>

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:11.370
Doing it in the clubroom would probably be the best, right?

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:12.120
Yeah...

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:16.120
The only problem is setting it up without getting caught by Senpai.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.080
Hmm...

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.920
Isurugi-senpai!

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:21.460
What is it, Hayama?

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:27.590
Tarou said, "I'm so tired, and I just had the worst day of my life because of that minuscule-chested bitch."

00:17:27.590 --> 00:17:28.590
Huh?!

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:29.510
Hey!

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:30.680
You're stalling for time.

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:31.760
I'm counting on you.

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:35.560
I-Is what I just heard true?

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:40.190
Of course, you flat-chested bitch!

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:44.360
I-I'm sick of you bossing me around!

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:46.030
Like, what's with that chest of yours?

00:17:46.030 --> 00:17:48.490
Look, look, I'm breastless Mio-chan!

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:56.710
Instant kill!

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:02.340
Wait, you bastard!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:05.260
Wait right there!

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:07.840
I'm not angry at all; just stop for a sec, you freaking pervert!

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:09.930
That's such a lie!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.190
<b>I pray for your good luck ! !
Just a little bit more!
</b>Good luck!
Hayama
Tatsukichi

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:27.360
There!

00:18:31.280 --> 00:18:34.160
No matter where you hide, I'll murder you.

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:35.740
Wait up, goddamn it!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.120
Wait!

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:39.500
Tatsukichi, hurry up!

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:41.960
Hold on, you bastard!

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.340
Wait!

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:48.300
You won't get away now.

00:18:48.300 --> 00:18:50.510
Give up already!

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:56.770
She should just go ahead and say it.

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:59.430
"It's my birthday."

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.270
It's easy as that, isn't it?

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:02.270
Isurugi Mio

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:04.310
She could even grant a wish of her own.
Isurugi Mio

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.070
Isurugi Mio

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:07.360
So why is she trying to grant those of others?

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:11.990
She's always, always worrying about the others.

00:19:12.320 --> 00:19:14.160
Yet she never tells us the important things...

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:17.080
It's here!

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:22.670
We're fellow club members, so I'll at least hear your last words.

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:24.330
Senpai!

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:27.750
How do you feel about me?

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:32.430
There's something I haven't been able to tell you this whole time!

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:36.850
Wh-What are you saying all of a sudden?

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:40.230
I feel I'll be able to say it right now...

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:41.690
But...

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:43.480
You see...

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:45.270
I...!

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:46.770
Wh-What?!

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:48.270
What is it?!

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:52.780
You really don't have any, do you?

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:57.490
Y-Y-You fucking asshole!

00:19:57.490 --> 00:20:00.290
Catch me if you can!

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:03.960
I'll chase you down to the depths of Hell!

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:07.000
Disappear, you dipshit!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:09.880
You fucking pig!

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:11.840
Stop!

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:18.010
Making me go through all this...

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:20.090
You goddamn perverted swine!

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.570
Happy Birthday
<i>Mio-senpai</i>

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:29.610
Today...

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:30.690
Happy Birthday
<i>Mio-senpai</i>

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:31.690
is your birthday, isn't it?

00:20:31.690 --> 00:20:33.190
Happy Birthday
<i>Mio-senpai</i>

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:33.740
<i>Mio-senpai
Happy Birthday</i>

00:20:33.740 --> 00:20:35.070
Pig-boy...?

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:39.410
That's why we all decided to throw you a surprise party.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:44.620
Though you may not like this kind of stuff...

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:50.380
today is still a very special day: the day when you were born.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:53.050
Congratulations, Mio-san!

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:58.640
Mio-san

00:21:01.680 --> 00:21:03.730
Isn't this great, Mio?

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:09.860
Senpai...

00:21:13.820 --> 00:21:15.400
D-Don't get me wrong...

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.910
No, I mean...

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:18.870
It's just...

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:20.280
Um...

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:23.370
I-It's not like that.

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:24.830
It isn't!

00:21:25.210 --> 00:21:26.250
I...

00:21:33.130 --> 00:21:34.170
Senpai.

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:39.300
Now, now. Hurry up and blow it out in one breath!

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:41.390
It's the protagonist's job.

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:43.260
Okay!

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:48.520
Oh, there's something I have to do before that.

00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:49.310
Hm?

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:55.570
Before I extinguish the flame of these candles,
I have to extinguish the life of this guy over here first.

00:21:55.570 --> 00:21:57.780
Y-You sure say some funny things there...

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:00.780
You think I'm joking?

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:04.660
Well, it's a celebration after all. A celebration...

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:38.990
Happy birthday.

00:22:38.990 --> 00:22:40.320
Happy birthday, Mio-san!

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:43.490
Thanks, everyone!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:03.390
Thank you, Tarou.

00:23:08.020 --> 00:23:11.020
I have something I'd like to give you.

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:13.970
This is my...

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:21.640
Christmas present to you!

00:23:23.820 --> 00:23:27.990
Merry Cruelmas!

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:40.190
<b>Tarou - Arashiko - Noa -
Yumi - Tatsukichi - Michiru
I pray for all of Mio-san's
wishes to come true</b>
